ant].sha256===ordinary[variant].sha256&&item[variant].bytes===ordinary[variant].bytes);\n   }\n   return pair;\n  });\n  normalized={group,faults:{ids:schedule.faultIds,residents,scope:'TEST_ONLY_FIXED_M_SOURCE_FAULTS',ordinaryCompilerUnchanged:true,disposed:true},\n   transport:{ids:schedule.transportIds,residents:transported,scope:'EXACT_ORDINARY_M_THEN_FIXED_NATIVE_TRANSPORT',directRoute:false,disposed:true},\n   SourceQualified:false,Task1Pass:false};\n }\n need(JSON.stringify(value)===JSON.stringify(normalized));\n return normalized;\n}\n","pending":["Integrate three named child loops into current controller; bootstrap state/readback and diagnostics must bind active bootstrap/child. Keep4 total guarded Node processes inclpreflight.","Read distinct group-specific startup files, never reset absolute330s. Clamp each180s group toremaining;case120s.","Materialize tool-only fault compiler only test/fixtures/finite-first-get-fault-tool.mjs, Source13 unchanged. Measure all tool inputs after children.","Use24576+LF1 outcome cap from brief, keep4096 startup diagnostic. Validate strict sanitized receipts thenaggregate fullcomponent/fault results.","Complete current proof schema/WF syntaxlist/new group pins/deltas/flatmountgraph. Existingcontroller/WF/proof still stale257MODEL/partial1group."],"testsExecuted":0,"nativeReleased":false}
